'''Dark Contract''' (闇を秘めし契約者, ''Yami o Himeshi Keiyakusha'', '''Contractors with Hidden Darkness''') is a 4-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Starting Money UP (L): Wallet starts with 1000¢.

